    "updated_at": "2021-04-22T10:11:33Z",
    "body": "In https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6315 I'm going to spec what browsers currently do.\r\n\r\nIn this model, a [session history entry](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#session-history-entry) has a [document state](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#document-state). That state is shared between history entries that share the same document.\r\n\r\nThat means, if the document is discarded, or is updated following a reload, it updates across all the history entries that share the document state.\r\n\r\nI followed up in https://github.com/WICG/app-history/issues/99#issuecomment-824629248, in case we need to help developer to do the right thing.",
